        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 6
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: each of these cards is steeped in the scent of its own sin, which, like
      smoke, dissolves into the air when stirred by the wafts of other scents unknown
      to man nearby.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
